Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:18:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 20/22] POC-11d: partner chips (story slots, friendship levels,
 FOLDER > PARTNER page)

Slots open at the Route 103 rival battle and badges 3, 5, 7. Each holds a
party Pokemon (by Navi ID) and one of its moves; in battle the chip (code *)
switches that Pokemon in and uses the move (costs the Custom), at x1 / x1.3 /
x1.6 power for friendship <150 / 150 / 220 (V1-V3). The chip shows the
Pokemon's icon. pkbn.sav v3 (v1/v2 migrate).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
